     "title": "General",
     "body": "Fixed a bug that occasionally caused heroes to be pulled down during a ledge mantle. Badges and Emblems are now correctly reflecting your player rank. Fixed an issue that caused large FPS drops at the start and end of matches on PlayStation® 5 consoles. Fixed a bug where the avoid list might not be respected during backfills.",
